00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.360
JENNY BROWN: Absolutely.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.860
So containers
address the problem

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.810
of how to easily and
consistently deploy

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.440
apps in different environments.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.470
They essentially allow
apps to be broken down

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:53.010
